  /// The element at `i`; panics if `i` is out of bounds.
  ///
  /// @example
  /// ```ts
  /// const xs = new Float32Array(2)
  /// xs.set(1, 0.5)
  /// println(xs.get(1))   // 0.5
  /// println(xs[0])       // 0
